+# Build Axolot Client 0.14.0
+
+1. Start from the bundled `axolot-core` source or clone the original Fast Client source supplied for this project.
+2. Run `python scripts/prepare_axolot_core.py axolot-core`.
+3. Build Core with Java 21: `cd axolot-core && gradlew.bat build` on Windows.
+4. Copy `axolot-core/build/libs/axolot-core-0.14.0*.jar` to `src-tauri/resources/axolot-client-core.jar`.
+5. Run `npm install`, `npm run build`, then `npm run tauri build -- --bundles nsis`.
+
+The release workflow performs the same steps, verifies the full Core feature inventory, creates the NSIS installer, computes SHA-256 and publishes the updater manifest.
