+# Axolot Client 0.14.0 RC — Nebula Prime
+
+## Launcher
+- Rebuilt the home screen into a denser desktop dashboard: active session, launch dock, quick commands, profile health, client pulse, account, Core and performance are visible without scrolling.
+- Reduced empty space throughout Profiles, Accounts, Mods and Settings while preserving internal scrolling for long lists.
+- Added quick profile presets for Performance, Clean Vanilla and Legacy PvP.
+- Axolot Core page now surfaces the complete inherited feature catalog instead of six generic cards.
+- Sidebar remains compact and expands over the workspace on hover, so page geometry never shifts.
+- Default window is larger and fully resizable/maximizable with lower minimum dimensions for common laptop screens.
+
+## Axolot Core 0.14.0
+- Keeps the complete Fast Client-derived feature set: 51 module/settings classes plus music, profiles, resource-pack conversion, embedded browser, Discord RPC, Hypixel integration and HUD editor.
+- Build-time verification fails if any expected Fast Client feature disappears.
+- Redesigned in-game home dashboard with dense module counts and category panels.
+- Preserves the Axolot cyan / blue / violet Material3 theme and Axolot branding.
+- Target remains Fabric + Minecraft 1.21.4 for this Core build; incompatible launcher profiles stay clean.
